506
00:30:02,191 --> 00:30:03,993
(Reporter Koo Hae Na,
Investigative Reporting Team)

507
00:30:18,370 --> 00:30:19,705
<i>The last meeting...</i>

508
00:30:20,673 --> 00:30:21,674
