520
00:31:02,448 --> 00:31:05,317
At this rate, I am going to suffocate
before we even get to the Meeting.

521
00:31:12,725 --> 00:31:14,693
What? What are you doing?

522
00:31:20,599 --> 00:31:21,834
So this is where it was.

523
00:31:23,602 --> 00:31:24,970
Darn it.

524
00:31:28,807 --> 00:31:31,243
This is not the fieldwork I dreamed of.

525
00:31:32,711 --> 00:31:35,614
My dream was to one day
