He ordered a lot of food.

527
00:32:07,713 --> 00:32:08,714
This looks delicious.

528
00:32:22,294 --> 00:32:24,964
Man, I am starving. Darn, I am hungry.

529
00:32:27,800 --> 00:32:29,835
All right, let's see.

530
00:32:31,203 --> 00:32:32,438
Sweet and sour pork.

531
00:32:33,238 --> 00:32:34,340
Chili pepper <i>japchae.</i>

532
00:32:34,340 --> 00:32:36,709
And<i> jjajangmyeon.</i>

533
00:32:40,613 --> 00:32:42,848
The bastard who burned
his own parents to death

534
00:32:42,848 --> 00:32:43,916
