535
00:32:43,949 --> 00:32:45,184
Unbelievable.

536
00:32:46,018 --> 00:32:49,021
He only got six years for killing
his parents for the inheritance?

537
00:32:49,054 --> 00:32:51,657
Diminished capacity,
and 50 pages of apologies a day.

538
00:32:52,024 --> 00:32:54,860
Everyone knows that.
That bastard is completely faking it...

539
00:32:55,995 --> 00:32:56,996
What?

540
00:32:58,864 --> 00:33:01,267
Damn it, this stupid fly... Shit.

541
00:33:16,649 --> 00:33:17,916
Damn it.

542
00:33:20,085 --> 00:33:21,320
What the hell? What is happening?

543
00:33:22,988 --> 00:33:24,723
What happened? Come on.

544
00:33:26,025 --> 00:33:28,794
Oh, come on. Seriously.

545
00:33:35,000 --> 00:33:36,835
It is a ten-millimeter
concentrate of Mist.

546
00:33:37,269 --> 00:33:39,805
<i>The shell is water-soluble,</i>
<i>so it dissolves on contact with water,</i>

547
00:33:39,805 --> 00:33:40,839
<i>and death occurs in under five minutes.</i>

548
00:33:41,173 --> 00:33:43,509
It decomposes within an hour,
so it will not show up in an autopsy.

549
00:33:44,677 --> 00:33:46,345
Ten seconds left on the clock.

550
00:33:46,378 --> 00:33:49,248
There is no time left. Hurry up.

551
00:33:50,349 --> 00:33:51,951
Now, five seconds left.

552
00:33:52,918 --> 00:33:57,823
Four, three, two, one.

553
00:33:57,856 --> 00:33:59,658
