554
00:33:59,692 --> 00:34:01,360
Three-point line, a three-pointer.

555
00:34:01,360 --> 00:34:03,963
Is it in? Is it in?

556
00:34:03,963 --> 00:34:05,564
It's in!

557
00:34:05,598 --> 00:34:07,299
A three-point buzzer-beater.

558
00:34:13,739 --> 00:34:15,541
Damn it. See? You can do it.

559
00:34:15,975 --> 00:34:17,776
What a grand finale.

560
00:34:17,810 --> 00:34:19,478
You should have played like that
from the start.

561
00:34:19,478 --> 00:34:21,747
They are getting ready for the playoffs.

562
00:34:36,228 --> 00:34:37,763
Meeting clear.

563
00:34:37,796 --> 00:34:39,164
Nice!

564
00:35:09,662 --> 00:35:10,796
Farewell.

565
00:35:13,032 --> 00:35:14,199
When you meet your parents,

566
00:35:14,934 --> 00:35:16,001
