567
00:35:18,671 --> 00:35:20,005
You rotten bastard.

568
00:35:27,279 --> 00:35:30,082
Since we successfully
wrapped up our last Meeting,

569
00:35:30,115 --> 00:35:31,483
let's have a team dinner for a change.

570
00:35:32,551 --> 00:35:34,320
How about some beef? Yes, let's get beef.

571
00:35:35,487 --> 00:35:37,856
By the way, this month's operating budget
is finalized.

572
00:35:38,857 --> 00:35:39,925
Okay.

573
00:35:40,559 --> 00:35:42,695
Okay, then how about beef?

574
00:35:42,695 --> 00:35:47,099
Let's get beef!
How about beef? Let's get beef!

575
00:35:51,136 --> 00:35:53,005
<i>It's not your fault</i>
<i>that Yul is missing.</i>

576
00:35:54,473 --> 00:35:56,809
<i>So please don't cry. I'll find her.</i>

577
00:36:16,061 --> 00:36:19,331
<i>When you can't stop thinking</i>
<i>about someone all day,</i>

578
00:36:19,331 --> 00:36:23,769
<i>and you smile every time, is that love?</i>

579
00:36:24,737 --> 00:36:25,738
<i>Busy.</i>

580
00:36:27,406 --> 00:36:29,775
<i>I think I'm in love.</i>

581
00:36:30,609 --> 00:36:32,077
(Se Ah: I Think I'm In Love.)

582
00:36:32,077 --> 00:36:33,545
(Horaengsseu: Lol)

583
00:36:39,218 --> 00:36:41,887
<i>Forget it. What would you know about love?</i>

584
00:36:42,521 --> 00:36:43,722
<i>What would you know?</i>
<i>You've never dated.</i>

585
00:36:43,722 --> 00:36:44,723
Look who's talking.

586
00:36:49,161 --> 00:36:50,796
<i>Then give me some advice.</i>

587
00:36:50,796 --> 00:36:52,731
<i>I've never felt this way before,</i>
<i>so I don't know what to do.</i>

588
00:36:55,868 --> 00:36:57,036
<i>First, ask to meet him.</i>

589
00:36:57,569 --> 00:36:58,837
<i>You have to meet up to get dumped.</i>

590
00:37:02,041 --> 00:37:03,309
<i>Can I really do that?</i>

591
00:37:04,209 --> 00:37:05,945
<i>Or create a chance</i>
<i>to meet him naturally.</i>

592
00:37:08,747 --> 00:37:09,748
<i>How?</i>

593
00:37:11,350 --> 00:37:12,418
<i>Busy.</i>

594
00:37:14,620 --> 00:37:16,121
He doesn't know either.

595
00:37:19,158 --> 00:37:21,794
A chance to meet them naturally?

596
00:37:31,604 --> 00:37:32,938
Seriously.

597
00:37:41,013 --> 00:37:42,681
Aunt Se Ah, what brings you here
at this hour?

598
00:37:42,681 --> 00:37:44,249
I came to see Yul.

599
00:37:44,249 --> 00:37:45,818
- Auntie.
- This looks delicious.

600
00:37:45,818 --> 00:37:48,253
<i>Sangju</i> dried persimmons. Yul's favorite.

601
00:37:48,287 --> 00:37:49,455
Aah!

602
00:37:49,455 --> 00:37:50,522
Here comes the airplane.

603
00:37:51,991 --> 00:37:53,826
Open wider.

604
00:37:54,460 --> 00:37:56,829
Captain, that's not the correct route.
I will change course.

605
00:37:56,862 --> 00:37:59,732
No. Not this way.
Captain, I don't want to eat.

606
00:38:00,866 --> 00:38:03,435
