644
00:39:55,414 --> 00:39:58,150
Nothing beats toilet paper.
So that everything goes smoothly for them.

645
00:39:58,150 --> 00:40:00,853
Come on, diffusers are the trendy gift
these days.

646
00:40:01,520 --> 00:40:03,122
How about a set of wine glasses?

647
00:40:03,155 --> 00:40:05,224
The wine itself is better
than the glasses.

648
00:40:07,660 --> 00:40:09,528
By the way,
isn't Manager Tae Min going with us?

649
00:40:10,195 --> 00:40:11,664
Oh, Manager Tae Min
doesn't really go out,

650
00:40:11,664 --> 00:40:12,932
