651
00:40:12,965 --> 00:40:14,566
He's a total homebody.

652
00:40:15,167 --> 00:40:18,037
Right. It'd be an imposition
since they have a child.

653
00:40:19,471 --> 00:40:21,073
Oh, how about a mood lamp
for a nice touch?

654
00:40:25,210 --> 00:40:26,445
Let's just keep it simple.

655
00:40:27,513 --> 00:40:28,580
You know what I mean, right?

656
00:40:30,416 --> 00:40:32,251
We'll get the wine that I like.

657
00:40:34,954 --> 00:40:36,288
He had his mind made up the whole time.

658
00:40:37,823 --> 00:40:39,224
Pork belly, short ribs.

659
00:40:39,224 --> 00:40:40,359
- On sale today.
- The short ribs.

660
00:40:40,359 --> 00:40:41,794
- Come and take a look.
- Okay.

661
00:40:41,794 --> 00:40:43,162
- Pork belly and short ribs are...
- How about this one?

662
00:40:43,162 --> 00:40:45,397
This one. It's big. So big, right?

663
00:40:47,499 --> 00:40:48,734
Okay.

664
00:40:52,204 --> 00:40:54,273
What's next on the list?

665
00:40:55,874 --> 00:40:59,478
Pollock and two mackerels. Right?

666
00:40:59,478 --> 00:41:00,813
Hm?

667
00:41:00,813 --> 00:41:03,215
- Let's go.
- Mom, squid, squid.

668
00:41:03,215 --> 00:41:04,650
You want to get squid now?

669
00:41:05,517 --> 00:41:06,819
Veggies, veggies.

670
00:41:06,819 --> 00:41:09,822
Should we get veggies now?
Okay, then we'll be all done.

671
00:41:11,657 --> 00:41:13,926
- Then what else was there?
- Look at the cart.

672
00:41:14,994 --> 00:41:17,229
Wow, she's so excited.

673
00:41:19,632 --> 00:41:20,799
We should have done this sooner.

674
00:41:21,533 --> 00:41:23,802
But you know,
your wife is a real mystery.

675
00:41:23,802 --> 00:41:27,373
There's so much she hasn't done
or experienced.

676
00:41:27,406 --> 00:41:29,308
Seriously,
what kind of life has she lived?

677
00:41:30,142 --> 00:41:31,277
Do you know anything?

678
00:41:31,310 --> 00:41:32,311
