679
00:41:34,480 --> 00:41:36,715
What? I'm her husband. Of course I know.

680
00:41:38,150 --> 00:41:39,151
He has no idea.

681
00:41:40,519 --> 00:41:41,920
Hey.

682
00:41:42,688 --> 00:41:45,324
- Hey, can you get a cart? A cart.
- Okay.

683
00:41:45,357 --> 00:41:48,894
- Hey.
- Oh, Se Ah, hold on.

684
00:41:49,695 --> 00:41:53,899
Oh, that hacker
who came to the playground.

685
00:41:54,733 --> 00:41:57,136
You know, your colleague.

686
00:41:57,136 --> 00:41:58,671
Oh, Ki Young Do.

687
00:41:58,671 --> 00:42:02,174
Oh, so his name is Ki Young Do.

688
00:42:02,207 --> 00:42:04,410
What a name...

689
00:42:04,443 --> 00:42:06,512
Don't worry.

690
00:42:08,013 --> 00:42:09,014
Thanks.

691
00:42:11,116 --> 00:42:15,487
So, what kind of food does he like?

692
00:42:17,122 --> 00:42:18,257
I'm not sure.

693
00:42:19,558 --> 00:42:24,630
Well, I'm just so grateful to him
for helping us find Yul.

694
00:42:24,630 --> 00:42:26,265
As a thank-you.

695
00:42:26,265 --> 00:42:28,734
As a thank-you,
even if it's just one side dish,

696
00:42:28,734 --> 00:42:32,304
I thought it would be right
to add something he likes.

697
00:42:33,872 --> 00:42:35,207
That's a good point.

698
00:42:35,207 --> 00:42:36,842
What should I make?

699
00:42:38,310 --> 00:42:39,845
He's a picky eater.

700
00:42:39,845 --> 00:42:42,114
Oh, he's a picky eater.

701
00:42:42,982 --> 00:42:47,319
Even so, is there anything
he still seems to enjoy?

702
00:42:57,596 --> 00:42:58,764
- Hello.
- Nice to meet you.

703
00:42:58,764 --> 00:43:02,768
- Hello, it's nice to meet you.
- Yes, hello. Please, come on in. Come in.

704
00:43:02,768 --> 00:43:04,703
- Please, come in.
- Let's see. Pardon the intrusion.

705
00:43:06,138 --> 00:43:07,606
She has a nice home.

706
00:43:09,642 --> 00:43:11,810
- Come in, come in.
- Okay, yes.

707
00:43:11,844 --> 00:43:13,012
- Honey.
- Yes?

708
00:43:13,012 --> 00:43:15,281
- They're here.
- You made it.

709
00:43:15,948 --> 00:43:17,716
Thank you all for coming.

710
00:43:20,052 --> 00:43:21,987
This is my husband, Kwon Tae Sung.

711
00:43:22,388 --> 00:43:23,489
It's a pleasure to meet you all.

712
00:43:23,522 --> 00:43:26,225
I'm sorry it's taken so long
to have you over.

713
00:43:27,026 --> 00:43:28,627
Thank you so much for coming.

714
00:43:28,627 --> 00:43:31,997
We're the ones who should be thanking you
for inviting us.

715
00:43:31,997 --> 00:43:33,265
Not at all.

716
00:43:33,265 --> 00:43:36,335
Gosh, your husband is very handsome.

717
00:43:40,706 --> 00:43:43,842
Yul, say hello.
These are Mommy's friends from work.

718
00:43:43,842 --> 00:43:46,812
- Hello.
- Hi. So you're Yul.

719
00:43:47,880 --> 00:43:49,949
Hey, mind if we look around the house?

720
00:43:49,949 --> 00:43:51,684
- Of course. Go ahead.
- Make yourselves at home.

721
00:43:51,684 --> 00:43:53,118
Yes, come on in.
Make yourselves at home.

722
00:43:53,152 --> 00:43:54,586
You all brought so much.

723
00:43:54,586 --> 00:43:56,322
- They are all for you.
- You can definitely tell

724
00:43:56,322 --> 00:43:59,692
